# Which permissions and certificates we require as a physical shop operator (that serves online customer only) to sell fresh food / frozen food / alcohol. We will also have a takeaway possibility, but no option to go as a user and pick goods from the shelf.



The Estonian VTA has a very good [overview of the process|https://pta.agri.ee/en/food/retail-trade-and-catering] and documents required (most available in both Estonian and Russian).  If we sell food that needs special temperatures (e.g. frozen), then we need [*an activity licence*|https://pta.agri.ee/ettevotjale-tootjale-ja-turustajale/toidu-tootmine/tegevusload-ja-teavitamine] *(tegevusluba).* If we don’t, then we just need to provide an Economic activity notice.



In addition to that, the following requirements apply: 

Each food business operator (FBO) must draw up a self-control plan and keep it up to date. Guidance material for the preparation of a self-control plan can be found [here|https://pta.agri.ee/ettevotjale-tootjale-ja-turustajale/toidu-tootmine/uldised-nouded#enesekontrolliplaan];

* When handling food, it is important that the premises and layout helps to produce food safely. Requirements for buildings and premises can be found [here|https://pta.agri.ee/ettevotjale-tootjale-ja-turustajale/toidu-tootmine/uldised-nouded#nuded-hoonetele-ja-];
* Instructions for water used in food handling can be found [here|https://pta.agri.ee/ettevotjale-tootjale-ja-turustajale/toidu-tootmine/uldised-nouded#joogivesi];
* Food must be properly labelled. More information about food labelling can be found [here|https://ec.europa.eu/food/safety/labelling_nutrition/labelling_legislation/mandatory-food-information_en];
* FBO must have knowledge of food hygiene / safety and must have completed food hygiene training;
* Personnel must have valid [health certificates|https://pta.agri.ee/ettevotjale-tootjale-ja-turustajale/toidu-tootmine/uldised-nouded#tervisetendid];
* Additional requirements for the sale of alcohol can be found in [here|https://pta.agri.ee/toidu-muuk#alkoholi-mk].

