Trip Payments (with VAT) - total sum of finished tips payments + cancellation fees and adjusted for fraud deductions for the orders that successfully completed price review. 
Tips - total tips received for the finished orders that successfully completed price review;
Refunds (with VAT) - total client refunds issued from driver to rider;
Commission (with VAT) - bolt service fee charges (as % of ride price on finished and client cancelled trips);
Referral Bonuses and Other Incentives Compensations (with VAT) - total sum of campaign bonuses issued as compensations (self-invoices) from driver to Bolt;
Miscellaneous Compensations (with VAT) - other small irregular CS compensations (compensations for price reviews, cleaning fees, etc.);
Referral Bonuses and Other Incentives Discounts (with VAT) - total sum of campaign bonuses issued as commission discounts (negative invoice rows) from Bolt to driver;
Miscellaneous Discounts (with VAT) - other small irregular CS commission discounts(compensations for price reviews, cleaning fees, etc.);
Miscellaneous Deductions (with VAT) - other small irregular CS deductions(fraud, speeding tickets etc.);{noformat}

